==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|a}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*kasvadak}}. Possibly an ancient loan from {{etyl|ine-pro|fi}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ewks-}} (from {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ewg-||to grow}}), with regular metathesis from {{m|fiu-fin-pro||*kawsa-}}. Cognate with {{cog|et|kasvama}}, {{cog|liv|kazzõ|ka'zzõ}}, {{cog|vot|kazvaa}}, {{cog|myv|касомс}}, and probably {{cog|hu|haszon}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|/ˈkɑsvɑː(ʔ)/}}
* Rhymes: [[rasvaa]]
* {{hyphenation|kas|vaa|lang=fi}}

